  "notes": "Fanless single channel edge encoder (Qualcomm Snapdragon) with Docker container support. Video in: HDMI 1.4a or 3G-SDI (one channel; up to 8 embedded audio channels on SDI), plus a 3.5 mm line level analog audio in. Encodes H.264/AVC or H.265/HEVC up to 3840x2160p30; RTMP, SRT, HLS, UDP/RTP, recording to USB 3.0 or SD card (MPEG-TS or MP4, FAT32), FTP upload. KLV metadata (SMPTE 336M) and SMPTE 2038 ANC from SDI. Network: 1 x 10/100/1000 RJ45. Power: +12V DC in or IEEE 802.3af PoE, 8 W total. Front: SD card slot and an Action button (start/stop RTMP streaming). 127 x 38 x 107.5 mm (5.0 x 1.5 x 4.234 in, W x H x D read from Videon's figures), weight not published. No SDI or HDMI out. Rear, left to right: Ethernet over 3G-SDI input, HDMI in, USB 3.0, DC 12V over audio in. Front: power LED, SD slot, Action button, Source/Record/Stream LEDs. Three fit in 1RU on the Videon Horizontal Rack Mount Tray.",
